0..77 Comment "//! Two products of one size count the same applications of a free successor."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..151 Comment "//! Grégoire and Leroy normalise Church numerals, whose normal forms"
152..168 Comment "//! apply a free"
169..249 Comment "//! successor many times. Comparing 256 times 64 with 64 times 256 needs a large"
250..263 Comment "//! readback."
264..267 Comment "//!"
268..345 Comment "//! The iteration applies a free `s` to a free `z` as many times as a product"
346..410 Comment "//! counts. Both endpoints read back as 256 applications of `s`."
411..414 Comment "//!"
415..495 Comment "//! - cites: [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction], § 6"
496..534 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
535..538 Comment "//!"
539..712 Comment "//! [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction]: https://doi.org/10.1145/581478.581501 \"Grégoire and Leroy, A compiled implementation of strong reduction\""
